'use strict';
// The Quarry Caves long ago: the words (DESIGN.md 18.10 "T2b", game/TIME.md "The Quarry Caves (T2b)"). Every line in es / pt / de, zh and ja in
// CJK.md's notation, and the English the weave mixes from ({w.qr_*}: this world's words, met as they're said). quarry_past.js is
// the camp, quarry_past_dungeon.js the old deep gallery, quarry_time_boss.js Grandma Echo; time_quarry.js (QUART) says,
// demonstrates and grades them.
// The grammar rung (TIME.md §8, rung 3): the imperfect for habits, «antes los mineros cantaban», with «siempre», «cada día»,
// «antes». People tell what they used to do (1st person, in demonstrations); you tell it back, about them (3rd person: «Elio
// escuchaba», «los mineros cantaban»), and, in the song, about all of you («cada día picábamos»). One time only is the preterite,
// a B («cantaron»: "that's once"); the present misses ("that's now"). pt: the imperfeito (-ava, -ia); de: the Präteritum with
// «früher, immer, jeden Tag» (the Perfekt is an A: "in a story, the Präteritum"); zh: 以前 / 那时候 + 每天 / 常常 / 总是 and no
// 了 (a bare verb is an A: "say when"); ja: ～て いました / ～た もの です (～ました is a B: once).
// The cast (each language its own): the forewoman (today's Cande's mother), young Cande, young Efraín (today's old miner, then
// the camp's songwriter), the lamplighter, the blacksmith, the cook and an old miner who tells stories.
